# The FAISS index is intentionally NOT gitignored: committing it lets
# Streamlit Cloud (or any other deploy) skip the scrape+embed step on
# cold start. It's ~10 MB and built reproducibly. Gitignore the raw
# HTML cache instead -- that one is sizable and easily regenerated.

